quantum-adiabatic/Adiabatic/Propagator.lean adapts the factorial Picard-iterate
argument from Mathlib/Analysis/ODE/PicardLindelof.lean at revision
8f9d9cff6bd728b17a24e163c9402775d9e6a365.
Copyright (c) 2021 Yury Kudryashov.
Original authors: Yury Kudryashov and Winston Yin.
The adapted construction acts on all continuous curves on the unit interval
to establish global existence for a uniformly globally Lipschitz vector field.

The proof-integrity checkers in generalized-equipartition/checks and
quantum-backflow/checks are adapted from quantum-adiabatic/checks.

Other dependency notices remain in their respective packages.
